      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/DocxAnnotationReader.cs — the EXISTING reader of pre-existing `w:ins`/`w:del`/`w:comment`; project its output into the editor model (do not reimplement the read)</file>
      <file role="dependency-output">src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/widgets/ — task 021 opaque-atom node (reuse for non-renderable imported constructs) + the existing track-change marks (`InsertionMark`/`DeletionMark`/`CommentAnchorMark`)</file>
      <file role="dependency-output">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/ComposeShadowPatchEngine.cs — task 030 unified Patch Engine (imported anchors patch back through it at their paraId on save)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/widgets/paraIdExtension.ts — key imported anchors by paraId so they survive save</file>
